    correctAnswer: 1,
    explanation: "1. The formula for pH is: $\\text{pH} = -\\log_{10}[\\text{H}^+]$.\n2. Substituting the hydrogen ion concentration: $\\text{pH} = -\\log_{10}(2.50 \\times 10^{-4}) = 3.60$.",
