    question: "Consider the reversible reaction in the Contact process:\n2SO₂(g) + O₂(g) ⇌ 2SO₃(g)   ΔH = -197 kJ/mol\nWhich combination of conditions produces the highest equilibrium yield of sulfur trioxide (SO₃)?",
