      { text: "(a) n(SO₂) = 0.80 mol, n(O₂) = 0.40 mol; (b) Total moles = 2.80 mol; (c) p(SO₂) = 71 kPa, p(O₂) = 36 kPa, p(SO₃) = 143 kPa; (d) Kp = 0.112 kPa⁻¹" }
